    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠβιστ-άω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠβιστ-έω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Opp.
			<u>C.</u>
			4.263
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύβη</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tumble head foremost</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ μάλ᾽ ἐλαφρὸς ἀνήρ, ὡς ῥεῖα
					κυβιστᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.745
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				749
			</span></i>; of fish, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ καλὰ ῥέεθρα
				κυβίστων ἔνθα καὶ ἔνθα</span>
			<i>tumbled</i> or <i>plunged about</i>, <i><span class="en">
				21.354
			</span></i>, cf. Opp.l.c.; esp. of professional tumblers, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				190a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. εἰς ξίφη, εἰς
			μαχαίρας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.3.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				294e
			</span></i>.</div>
